Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "VehicleApproachingHeadOn" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :BehaviorAnomaly ;
    :hasActor :vehicle1 ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :weather1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1 .

:vehicle1 a :Vehicle ;
    :description "Black vehicle approaching ego-vehicle in the same lane" .

:weather1 a :ClearCondition ;
    :description "Daytime clear weather conditions" .

:risk1 a :CollisionRisk ;
    :description "Head-on collision risk with oncoming vehicle in ego-lane" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.95"^^xsd:float .

Identified Risks for each risk class
Risk 1:
Description: Head-on collision risk with an oncoming vehicle that has intruded into the ego-vehicle's lane.
Severity Score: 0.95